<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,426 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,426 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,426 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,424 on Friday. Dealers said the central bank sold $0.50 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Oct 14		  Oct 11</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,426		   5,424</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	2.54		    9.95</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
